◆ Approvals
  With auto, the agents work and merge on their own under the rules. Change that
  any time in /permissions and /approvals.

  ❯ 1. Auto (recommended)
       Rules and a reviewer from another AI company decide, and you're asked
       when a rule fails.
    2. Supervised
       You approve the goal, the plan, and every merge.
    3. Shadow
       You approve, and Argonauts learns what it would have decided.

